<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-19T13:38:42.814Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:38:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran President Bukele confirmed an airstrike that destroyed gang leader Jeff's luxury mansion, and Salvadoran forces later demolished another gang stronghold, killing about 20 gang members. Haiti formalised a security pact with El Salvador and deployed Salvadoran troops who have engaged in combat against gangs, prompting both supportive and oppositional street protests in Port-au-Prince. The United Nations warned that anti-gang operations must prioritise civilian protection, and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/18/bukele-confirms-airstrike-on-haitian-gang-leader-jeffs-luxury-mansion&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1rak13TzB4RDI2dHVkbUx1NC15STNuUGY4VzRhaFJaOUNsbkJQZ2lKMGVqaVFCRGc4Tko5Q2w1T2RxRkhoa0daNTJfM2ZFN3BMOUJmZ19Fa3M1ZzgwMFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPbFdBVHB4R3lseWk0Mmh2eU1rUjdEYTZmRVFjMGhkVEJvYzc2eVhvNHJtdE9pZFVPNFlNWVBKa3hJbTBQcUhLYURoN2hpR2xFc0oxN1lQMXN2ZUdwYkN3WHBPLU42OTdYMHg3M2pWSkFtMjd5SjFiZUVKalFGVDRSZ2FHT3l4akwyNzR0c3dYLTZRcml2S1ZhbmdobWhTS1BLN3ZkNkx3NDZtdWl5TWJsVXNtRjJqbkxl0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1FdFVOM1doR0lzT0NlSkkzMDg2M2NsZDVNVFhMOTc0NVVnWk5EdF9tWWlWbUt2VDhSN2x3R3kxcVpFRFJyVF9RdHJVR1RiRENkYkFpVXdFaV9mUi1oazhEdG5GcjMzTDZXZXp2Vkk5OWs2WkVOc2NISHBzMGhDVHNta2pVYk4tM196VklJOFh2Rk1Mak5EbE5tWTNoWVZTN0pRYVRNdzA0WktRMldWM29JMWIzSERIdm56N0ZQLWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNMkRvbmJiUGVyTGZBUHREVVBXdUJzM3JzODRIcTA5WndqT25RY3JuQVN1NjJGa3JwSGlZVVZpNnFQa0FaYk9YNlN4bllWOGdIY20t